  Title: Rivernet (Pholi)
  Description: 'A city that was named after the most active and least respected of
    the old gods. Most people refer to this city by its nickname, <b>Rivernet</b>.

    Rivernet
    is the resource processing hub of Soza. Raw resources are washed downriver from
    <b>The Sky Holder</b> and refined here.'
